OL,3,AAt least 13 workers killed in landslide
OL,4,Aat Colombian gold mine
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 13 workers have been killed
OL,7,Fand another seven injured in a
OL,8,Flandslide at an unlicensed mine in
OL,9,Fsouthern Colombia, local officials say.
OL,11,FWitnesses described hearing an
OL,12,Fexplosion at the open-air artisanal
OL,13,Fgold mine on Wednesday afternoon,
OL,14,Fmoments before the workers below were
OL,15,Ftrapped.
OL,17,FEmergency workers and locals were able
OL,18,Fto retrieve the bodies with the help of
OL,19,Fdiggers.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
