OL,3,AAt least 13 workers killed in landslide
OL,4,Aat Colombian gold mine
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeadly accidents are not uncommon in
OL,7,FColombia, especially at unlicensed
OL,8,Fmines where locals dig for precious
OL,9,Fmetals without any official oversight.
